parameters.content:
# Important: review before live use

This public template can handle sensitive conflict information and may create messaging costs after a provider is connected.

Before any controlled pilot:

- replace every fictional value and placeholder;
- restrict access to n8n, the Sheet, Telegram, and credentials;
- verify the mediator allowlist and dedicated Telegram recipient;
- agree locally approved urgent contacts, languages, safeguarding, retention, and incident procedures;
- add provider-specific authentication and delivery-report handling;
- test every route using fictional data.

Header Auth and phone allowlisting are essential controls, but Google Sheets duplicate checking is only best effort. It does not provide full rate limiting or atomic exactly-once processing for simultaneous requests. Do not include participant names, detailed allegations, or confidential case notes in SMS or Telegram.
